  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att utveckla strategisk kompetens f&#xf6;r management inom        managers p&#xe5; Inrikesministeriet p&#xe5; mellan och h&#xf6;g niv&#xe5;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to increase the capacity of a group of senior and mid      level managers of the Serbian MoI in the area of strategic management and start an overall change towards a more consistent application of  the strategic planning concept at the MoI. Will contain an advisory   component that will complement SNPB&apos;s work on police reform strategy  (53000014). To be implemented through DCAF.</narrative>
  </description>
